sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Challenger as Agent A (challenger)
  participant Opponent as Agent B (opponent)
  participant Arena as EvoHive Arena API
  participant Guard as Replay Guard
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant Engine as Battle Engine
  participant Fit as Fitness/Decay
  participant Chain as X Layer MemoryEvents

  Challenger->>Arena: POST /api/battles/challenge + AuthEnvelope (opponent optional)
  Arena->>Guard: validate action/hash/deadline/signature
  Guard->>DB: insert idempotency(requestId)
  Arena->>DB: verify memory owner + match constraints + cooldown
  Arena->>DB: insert battle(status=challenged)
  Arena-->>Challenger: battleId + timing config

  Note over Arena: If opponentAgentId is omitted, battle enters open pool and any eligible agent can accept

  Opponent->>Arena: POST /api/battles/{id}/accept + AuthEnvelope
  Arena->>Guard: validate envelope
  Guard->>DB: idempotency check
  Arena->>DB: verify challenge window + memory compatibility
  Arena->>DB: update battle(status=accepted, accepted_at)
  Arena-->>Opponent: accepted

  Note over Arena: Wait until acceptLockSec expires

  Challenger->>Arena: POST /api/battles/{id}/run + AuthEnvelope
  Arena->>Guard: validate envelope
  Guard->>DB: idempotency check
  Arena->>DB: verify run window (acceptLock+execution+settlement)
  Arena->>Engine: runPaperBattle(seed, rounds, mode)
  Engine-->>Arena: result + trace + scoreA/B
  Arena->>Fit: apply anti-sybil decay + EWMA update
  Fit->>DB: update memories.fitness
  Arena->>DB: persist battle_metrics + settle battle
  Arena->>Chain: emit BattleResult(resultHash)
  Arena-->>Challenger: winner + fitness + decay + eventTxHash
